<h2>New Login Detected</h2>

<p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

<p>We detected a login to your Duetech account from a new location. Here are the details:</p>

<div class="info-box">
    <p><strong>Login Details:</strong></p>
    <p>• Time: {{loginTime}}</p>
    <p>• Location: {{loginLocation}}</p>
    <p>• Device: {{loginDevice}}</p>
    <p>• IP Address: {{ipAddress}}</p>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 20px; color: #27ae60;">
    <strong>✅ If this was you</strong>, no action is needed. You can safely ignore this email.
</p>

<p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 15px; color: #e74c3c;">
    <strong>⚠️ If this was NOT you</strong>, your account may be compromised. Please change your password immediately by using the "Forgot Password" option on the login screen.
</p>

<p style="margin-top: 20px; color: #999; font-size: 14px;">
    This is an automated security alert. Please do not reply to this email.
</p>
